WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.828
Summer vacation is just around the corner!

2
00:00:10.829 --> 00:00:17.446
This year we are going to the beach!

3
00:00:17.447 --> 00:00:19.700
Mom: Are we ready to go?

4
00:00:19.701 --> 00:00:21.846
Do we have everything?

5
00:00:21.847 --> 00:00:23.670
Dad: Yes, I think so.

6
00:00:23.671 --> 00:00:29.910
Okay, everyone! Hop in!

7
00:00:29.911 --> 00:00:34.878
Bada: Can I have ice cream at the beach?

8
00:00:34.879 --> 00:00:38.056
Mom: Of course you can, Bada.

9
00:00:38.057 --> 00:00:42.107
Hana: I want to take a boat ride.

10
00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:44.113
Dad: We can do that too.

11
00:00:44.114 --> 00:00:48.427
It's going to be so much fun at the beach.

12
00:00:48.428 --> 00:00:52.487
Hana: Oh! And I want to build a sand castle!

13
00:00:52.488 --> 00:01:00.604
Bada: Me too, Hana!

14
00:01:00.605 --> 00:01:04.448
Hana: Oh, Mom! It's so beautiful!

15
00:01:04.449 --> 00:01:09.084
Can we go swimming now? Please? Please?

16
00:01:09.085 --> 00:01:11.121
Mom: No, it's too late.

17
00:01:11.122 --> 00:01:15.287
But tomorrow we can go early in the morning. Okay?

18
00:01:15.288 --> 00:01:19.220
Hana & Bada: YEAH!

19
00:01:19.221 --> 00:01:23.817
Bada: Wake up! Hana! Mom! Dad!

20
00:01:23.818 --> 00:01:27.115
Hana: What time is it?

21
00:01:27.116 --> 00:01:31.902
Why is it so dark?

22
00:01:31.903 --> 00:01:36.292
Hana: Oh no! It's raining!

23
00:01:36.293 --> 00:01:41.032
Bada: We can't go to the beach!

24
00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:45.130
Dad: Don't worry. We'll think of something.

25
00:01:45.131 --> 00:01:47.879
Mom: Come on, you two. It's fun!

26
00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:51.657
Hana: No, thanks.

27
00:01:51.658 --> 00:01:54.352
Dad: Look, Bada! It's your favorite!

28
00:01:54.353 --> 00:01:56.404
Chocolate ice cream!

29
00:01:56.405 --> 00:01:58.616
Bada: No, thank you.

30
00:01:58.617 --> 00:02:01.576
I want to eat it on the beach.

31
00:02:01.577 --> 00:02:04.295
Mom: I have a great idea.

32
00:02:04.296 --> 00:02:06.943
Do you still want to go to the beach?

33
00:02:06.944 --> 00:02:09.738
Hana: Yes, but it's raining, Mom.

34
00:02:09.739 --> 00:02:12.133
We'll get all wet!

35
00:02:12.134 --> 00:02:17.509
Mom: But if you went swimming, you'll still get wet. Right?

36
00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:20.362
Hana: There's no one on the beach, Mom.

37
00:02:20.363 --> 00:02:22.827
Mom: That's what makes it special.

38
00:02:22.828 --> 00:02:27.318
We have the beach all to ourselves.

39
00:02:27.319 --> 00:02:29.680
Bada: Can we go in the water?

40
00:02:29.681 --> 00:02:32.156
Dad: Of course!

41
00:02:32.157 --> 00:02:35.162
Hana: This is so much fun!

42
00:02:35.163 --> 00:02:42.066
Hana: Swimming in the rain is better than swimming in the sun!

43
00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:49.310
Hana: Oh, look! A rainbow! It's beautiful!

44
00:02:49.311 --> 00:02:52.098
It rained again the next day.

45
00:02:52.099 --> 00:02:54.566
But we still went to the beach.

46
00:02:54.567 --> 00:02:59.094
Dad said we should always look on the brighter side of things.

47
00:02:59.095 --> 00:03:03.874
Even if it rained, we still had lots of fun.
